# The lamps' first search with the point's own texels (../README.md, "Правка в игре"): every view as three shots of one
# camera, `-old` the search as before 2026-11-14 (`vsm study 16`), `-new` the game's, `-old2` the old one again (the
# world does not stand still between shots: what differs between the two old ones is not the fix).
# Views: the hero's nape in Xardas' tower (profile from 120 cm, behind the ear from 60 cm), the candle- and torch-lit
# harbour house (four views), the night harbour at brazier 1 and at the lamp posts (four views).
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with the head> \
#     scripts/bench.sh reports/render-features/2026-11-14-lamp-stipple/tools/lamp-own.bench <out>
# The reference is the same run with OPENGOTHIC_VSM_LAMP=truth (its three shots of a view are all the reference).
#   python reports/render-features/2026-11-14-lamp-stipple/tools/own_pairs.py <out> <out of the reference> <sheets dir> [view ...]
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
blink off
overlay off
# 1. Xardas' tower, the torch: the hero's nape under the tail
set time 12 0
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 2500
vsm study 16
wait 1500
shot tower-nape-old
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 1500
shot tower-nape-new
wait 400
vsm study 16
wait 1500
shot tower-nape-old2
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 300
cam cut
cam face 60 140 1
wait 2000
vsm study 16
wait 1500
shot tower-ear-old
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 1500
shot tower-ear-new
wait 400
vsm study 16
wait 1500
shot tower-ear-old2
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 300
